      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "He even tried to profane the temple, and we arrested him.",
      "ko": "저가 또 성전을 더럽게 하려 하므로 우리가 잡았사오니",
      "source_text_hash": "1f41f18c59240fc703f3df38b447414d25758c4779a2f261a0188ee9f8b613a8",
      "translation_text_hash": "0c621de207f374728b2ccf0287c2efbf3aa4a07ffe679f23bd9652c481492906",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저가 또 성전을 더럽게 하려 하므로 우리가 잡았사오니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0c621de207f374728b2ccf0287c2efbf3aa4a07ffe679f23bd9652c481492906"
      ]
    },
    {
