      "en": "The Jews also joined in the attack, affirming that these things were so.",
      "ko": "유대인들도 이에 참가하여 이 말이 옳다 주장하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "c8de8ed61a11a3b05378cd60e75982aca8e5e22686d8c148db9238545f7aac2e",
      "translation_text_hash": "231f64cf63801138e4d20275443ee4eb9575b05d53de9ac9b470790ffb58f406",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
